  {
   "type": "generic_update",
   "title": "Hero Balance Updates",
   "role": null,
   "description": "Hero Balance Updates\n\nThese changes aim to re-adjust heroes whose win rates have fallen further than intended since the start of Season 2. We’re continuing to monitor mobile heroes adjusted this season to help inform the mid‑season changes. Our focus is on ensuring heroes feel viable and fun to play both as and against, while still meeting our goal of addressing mobility.",
